# Files `vercel deploy` does not upload (scripts/deploy-vercel.sh deploys both
# projects from the repository root). Gitignore syntax: a pattern without a
# leading slash matches at any depth.
#
# Vercel already skips .git, .vercel, .next, node_modules, .env.local,
# .dockerignore, .gitignore, ... (docs: builds/build-features).
# Hobby CLI uploads are capped at 100 MB, so build output must stay out.
#
# Needed by the builds:
#   topcoat (Container Runtime): Dockerfile only (it refers to the ghcr.io image)
#   nextjs (Root Directory nextjs/): nextjs/, ../data (copied by
#   nextjs/scripts/copy-data.mjs)

# Build output and generated files (rebuilt on Vercel)
target/
/topcoat/assets/
/nextjs/public/images/
/nextjs/src/generated/

# Secrets and local state
.env*
/deploy/

# Not used by either build
/.claude/
/.playwright-mcp/
/bench/
/docs/
/scripts/
/AGENTS.md
